{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-poster\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #fff9f4; box-sizing: border-box; color: #312521; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 18px; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; padding-top: 0; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-color: #b43e2b; box-sizing: border-box; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 24px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 24px 24px 24px; text-align: left; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; text-align: left\"\u003e观点鲜明的文章不需要绕弯子——一整块凌厉赤红海报开场，第一秒就把态度亮在台前。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 24px; margin-bottom: 0\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-color: #b43e2b; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 20px 16px; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-top: 16px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; padding: 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\"\u003e让核心立场一秒击中读者\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 12px auto 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0 0 8px; padding-bottom: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: left\"\u003e满幅朱赤开场宣言块搭配干脆利落的黑字正文与红色强调，极适合有锋芒的评论与行业观察。\u003c/p\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 20px 0 20px; padding: 0\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"border: 1px solid #eac5bc; color: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 0; padding: 12px 16px 12px; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e含糊的附和随处可见，敢亮明立场的声音才会被记住。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 0 20px; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/minimal-architecture.jpg\" alt=\"锋利明暗对比的现代建筑线条\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 24px; margin-bottom: 0\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-color: #312521; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 20px 16px; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-top: 16px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; padding: 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\"\u003e强观点长文的排版利器\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 12px auto 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0 0 8px; padding-bottom: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e热点事件深度评论与反常识洞察\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e品牌宣言、新品发声与行业倡议\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e高识别赤红色块，在列表中极其醒目\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003csection style=\"border-top: 1px solid #b43e2b; margin: 20px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding: 12px 0 0\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"border-top: 2px solid #b43e2b; color: #312521; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 0; padding: 12px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e亮出你的判断，评论区见真章。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
